{"toolCallId":"call_13384356a0ea479c816c5b97d4b0586e","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":".skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/graph/generated-metadata-drift.ts:195:export function checkGeneratedMetadataDrift(folderPath: string): GeneratedMetadataDriftReport {\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/graph/generated-metadata-drift.ts:305:export function resolveGeneratedMetadataDrift(\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/graph/README.md:75:| `checkGeneratedMetadataDrift` | generated-metadata-drift.ts | Re-derives and compares the stored synopsis fields; reads only |\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/graph/README.md:76:| `resolveGeneratedMetadataDrift` | generated-metadata-drift.ts | Turns a drift report into a caller-chosen severity |\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/graph/graph-metadata-parser.ts:2025:  checkGeneratedMetadataDrift,\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/graph/graph-metadata-parser.ts:2027:  resolveGeneratedMetadataDrift,\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/validation/orchestrator.ts:24:  checkGeneratedMetadataDrift,\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/validation/orchestrator.ts:25:  resolveGeneratedMetadataDrift,\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/validation/orchestrator.ts:930:  const report = checkGeneratedMetadataDrift(folder);\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/validation/orchestrator.ts:933:  const resolved = resolveGeneratedMetadataDrift(report, {\n.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/lib/validation/README.md:34:  -> checkGeneratedMetadataIntegrity() / checkGeneratedMetadataDrift()\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w904a7ae601/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"ce9f83","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
