{"toolCallId":"call_c499438e33594eed9996bdb186e175d5","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"10:# Spec Kit - Mandatory Conversation Documentation\n14:## 1. WHEN TO USE\n16:### What is a Spec Folder?\n28:### Activation Triggers\n48:### When NOT to Use\n59:### Distributed Governance Rule\n67:### Utility Template Triggers\n78:## 2. SMART ROUTING\n80:### Resource Domains\n97:### Template and Script Sources of Truth\n123:### Resource Loading Levels\n133:### Smart Router Pseudocode\n434:## 3. HOW IT WORKS\n436:### Core Workflow\n444:### Two Completion Gates\n460:### Retrieval and Continuity\n470:### Reranking\n474:### Security\n479:### Validation and Recovery\n483:### OpenCode Goal Plugin\n487:### Code Graph and Search Routing\n492:## 4. RULES\n494:### ✅ ALWAYS\n518:### ⛔ NEVER\n530:### ⚠️ ESCALATE IF\n545:## 5. SUCCESS CRITERIA\n551:## 6. INTEGRATION POINTS\n555:### Quick Reference Commands\n581:## 7. REFERENCES AND RELATED RESOURCES\n"}}],"_meta":{"cognition.ai/cwd":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Code-Environment-Public/fcd93cd7-b3f2-45e6-b976-87fabe792df3/scratchpad/speed-loop/w904a7ae601/tree","terminal_exit":{"terminal_id":"e7d318","exit_code":0,"signal":null},"cognition.ai/inferenceToolName":"exec"}}
